{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7670931328757680447","title":"操作系统项目经理-汽车","description":"1. 参与小米智能汽车操作系统的研发项目管理，跟进车型项目软件功能从需求到交付的全流程；\n2. 主导功能开发任务拆解与计划制定，跟踪项目进度与交付质量；\n3. 协调产品、研发、测试等多方团队，组织项目信息同步，推动关键问题闭环；\n4. 识别与管控项目风险，保障车型交付节点达成；\n复盘沉淀项目经验与流程规范，支撑多车型并行开发；\n5. 关注智能汽车行业趋势，参与产品创新探索；\n6. 在资深项目经理带教下，系统学习汽车软件开发流程与跨部门协作方法。","requirement":"1. 本科及以上学历，计算机、软件工程、电子信息、自动化、车辆工程等相关专业；\n2. 逻辑清晰，沟通表达与组织协调能力强，有责任心和推进力；\n3. 了解软件开发流程与项目管理基本方法（瀑布、敏捷）；\n4. 有项目管理 / 产品 / 研发方向实习，或学生会、社团、竞赛团队组织管理经历者优先。","recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786027978105,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7178759516879405165","name":"软件研发类","en_name":"Software R\u0026D","i18n_name":"软件研发类"},"job_id":"7670931328757516607","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_107","name":"南京","en_name":"Nanjing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"南京","py_name":"nanjing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000121","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"